{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんわあ (^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリタンポめっちゃめっちゃ\nおいちいねぇーー らぶらぶ。\n秋田すき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/07/13/1453549/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は 秋田県でliveでした ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セットリストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1、ガールズルール\n2、扇風機\n3、ぐるぐるカーテン\n4、狼に口笛を\n5、涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\n6、おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした〜(*´∇｀*)(*´∇｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場がいっぱいになる位の人が\n来てくれました ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しゅうです(^ω^)\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の本番始まる前だよん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/07/13/1453549/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろねっ\n秋田県に来るのが人生初めてで\nめちゃめちゃ楽しみにしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４時間かかった新幹線の中も\nわくわくして 全然疲れなかったっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田県の町がどんななのか興味あったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪でも東京でも見れない\n綺麗な星空にも興味あって、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、秋田の美味しいご飯も\n食べたかったし、\nキリタンポも食べたことなくて\n楽しみ過ぎてっっ (〃∨〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田べんも好きやしねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、かなりんと同じヘアスタイル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがよくやってる\nチョンマゲ巻きをしました )))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろのケースは\nRotty夢(月マーク)の\n月に まひろの「M」やねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/07/13/1453549/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃあ〜ねっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も 楽しみ、頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだー\nおやすみなさい...(*´ω｀*)"}],"source":"archive"}